ive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Consequences of Attraction","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2013-10-07","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030410/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07#:~:text=many%20of%20them%20walked,railing%20of%20the%20ship","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030410/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07","license":null,"text":"\"The Consequences of Attraction\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Oct 2013. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-consequences-attraction-2013-10-07-e3","era":null,"summary":"Xandria considers helping the mage on deck but refuses, remembering that the sirens punished her interference before.","participants":["xandria","the-sirens"],"location":"the-siren-sea","importance":"minor","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-consequences-attraction-2013-10-07","order":390,"story_date":"2013-10-07","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":8,"quote":"She would not help this man.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030410/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07#:~:text=She%20would%20not%20help%20this%20man.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Consequences of Attraction","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2013-10-07","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030410/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07#:~:text=She%20would%20not%20help%20this%20man.","archived":"https://we